ing out against the tax plan  because I'm jealous that the tax plan  was bad for me and good for other people  this tax reform was very good for me  okay I did a whole segment several  months ago when I had filed my taxes  explaining how even though the david  pakman show grew from 2017 to 2018 my  effective tax rate as the majority owner  of the David Pakman show  went down from 26% effective federal tax  rate for the 2017 tax year 26% down to  under 22% in 2018 I'll take the money  okay  but my point in talking about that in  talking about it again here is that it  is not economically stimu  in terms of policy to do the type of tax  reform that saves me like 15% on taxes  four out of 26 is roughly about 15% and  disproportionately more going to the  very very rich in corporations who are  saving the money who are using the money  to repurchase to do stock buybacks etc  last thing we call these the Trump tax  cuts but really their Republican tax  cuts so if you're not happy with the tax  reform plan  yes Trump is to blame and yes Trump  should be voted out in 2020 he supported  the tax plan he worked on the tax plan  with the Republicans but it's the  Republicans who wrote it and actually  pushed it through in the House and  Senate who are also responsible and they  should also be voted out in 2020 really  important not to forget that and blame  this all on Trump because it is much  much bigger than Donald Trump let me  know what you think I'm on Twitter at D  Pakman the show is on twitter at david  pakman show i've got a nice announcement  coming up later on the show today i hope  you'll stay with us if you love learning  new things you probably want to check  this out  the david pakman show today is sponsored  by Skillshare and we're giving you two  entire months of free access to  Skillshare when you click the link  underneath this video Skillshare is a  vibrant online learning community  offering more than 25,000 video classes  on just about anything you can think of  get better at playing an instrument  learn to use Photoshop how to edit  videos they have classes on drawing  painting business cooking nutrition  personal productivity and I'm not even  really scratching the surface I recently  took a great class on introductory  watercolour painting I'm still not good  but I am learning and you can access the  entire library of fun easy-to-use online  courses for free for two months by using  the link underneath this video two  months of learning something that's  totally new to you something you want to  get better at something you already love  or you can get ahead in your career by  learning new skills that will help you  at your job I've gotten a ton out of it  Pat has taken some courses that he's  found really valuable and I think you'll  love it to get started  for free by clicking the link under this  video
 

